#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "An invoice plan split by payer cannot have advance installments."
msgstr ""
"Um plano de faturamento dividido por pagador não pode ter parcelas de "
"adiantamento."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Each payer can appear only once in the plan."
msgstr "Cada pagador só pode aparecer uma vez no plano."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "Every installment of the plan needs a payer."
msgstr "Toda parcela do plano precisa de um pagador."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sale_invoice_plan_partner.field_sale_order_line__invoice_plan_payer_id
msgid "Fixed Payer"
msgstr "Pagador Fixo"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:sale_invoice_plan_partner.selection__sale_order__invoice_plan_mode__installment
msgid "Installments"
msgstr "Parcelas"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_invoice_plan_partner.field_sale_order__invoice_plan_mode
msgid ""
"Installments: the base plan, every invoice to the customer, one installment at a time.\n"
"Payers: one invoice per payer of the plan, all created at once."
msgstr ""
"Parcelas: o plano padrão, todas as faturas para o cliente, uma parcela por vez.\n"
"Pagadores: uma fatura por pagador do plano, todas criadas de uma vez."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sale_invoice_plan_partner.field_sale_order__invoice_plan_mode
msgid "Invoice Plan Mode"
msgstr "Modo do Plano de Faturamento"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model,name:sale_invoice_plan_partner.model_sale_invoice_plan
msgid "Invoice Planning Detail"
msgstr "Detalhe do Plano de Faturamento"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"Nothing to invoice to %(payer)s: its share is less than one unit of every "
"line. Change the percentages or set a fixed payer on the lines."
msgstr ""
"Nada a faturar para %(payer)s: a parte deste pagador é menor que uma unidade"
" em todas as linhas. Altere os percentuais ou defina um pagador fixo nas "
"linhas."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_invoice_plan_partner.field_sale_invoice_plan__payer_partner_id
msgid ""
"Partner invoiced for this installment when the plan splits the order by "
"payer."
msgstr ""
"Parceiro faturado nesta parcela quando o plano divide o pedido por pagador."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sale_invoice_plan_partner.field_sale_invoice_plan__payer_partner_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sale_invoice_plan_partner.view_sale_invoice_plan_filter
msgid "Payer"
msgstr "Pagador"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:sale_invoice_plan_partner.selection__sale_order__invoice_plan_mode__payer
msgid "Payers"
msgstr "Pagadores"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:sale_invoice_plan_partner.field_sale_invoice_plan__plan_date
msgid "Plan Date"
msgstr "Data do Plano"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_invoice_plan.py:0
msgid ""
"Plan quantity: %(plan_qty)s, exceed invoiceable quantity: %(invoiceable_qty)s\n"
"Product should be delivered before invoice"
msgstr ""
"Quantidade do plano: %(plan_qty)s, acima da quantidade faturável: %(invoiceable_qty)s\n"
"O produto deve ser entregue antes de faturar"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model,name:sale_invoice_plan_partner.model_sale_order
msgid "Sales Order"
msgstr "Pedido de Venda"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model,name:sale_invoice_plan_partner.model_sale_order_line
msgid "Sales Order Line"
msgstr "Linha do Pedido de Venda"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "The fixed payer of these lines is not in the invoice plan: %(lines)s"
msgstr ""
"O pagador fixo destas linhas não está no plano de faturamento: %(lines)s"

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_invoice_plan.py:0
msgid ""
"The payer of an invoiced installment cannot be changed. Cancel its invoices "
"first."
msgstr ""
"O pagador de uma parcela faturada não pode ser alterado. Cancele as faturas "
"dela antes."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_invoice_plan_partner/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid "The payers of the invoice plan must add up to 100%%, not %(total)s%%."
msgstr ""
"Os pagadores do plano de faturamento devem somar 100%%, não %(total)s%%."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_invoice_plan_partner.field_sale_order_line__invoice_plan_payer_id
msgid ""
"When the invoice plan splits by payer, the whole line is invoiced to this "
"payer instead of being split."
msgstr ""
"Quando o plano de faturamento divide por pagador, a linha inteira é faturada"
" para este pagador em vez de ser dividida."

#. module: sale_invoice_plan_partner
#: model:ir.model,name:sale_invoice_plan_partner.model_sale_make_planned_invoice
msgid "Wizard when create invoice by plan"
msgstr "Assistente para criar faturas pelo plano"
